### Probe Gemma4 Model - Simple Chat (No Tools)
# @name SimpleChat
POST http://192.168.1.14:10303/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "model": "gemma-4",
    "messages": [
        {"role": "user", "content": "Say 'Hello from Gemma4' in one sentence."}
    ],
    "temperature": 0.7,
    "max_tokens": 100
}

### Probe Gemma4 Model - With Tool/Function Calling
# @name ToolCalling
POST http://192.168.1.14:10303/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "model": "gemma-4",
    "messages": [
        {"role": "user", "content": "帮我查一下今天北京的天气"}
    ],
    "tools": [
        {
            "type": "function",
            "function": {
                "name": "get_weather",
                "description": "查询指定城市的天气",
                "parameters": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                        "city": {"type": "string", "description": "城市名称，例如：北京"},
                        "date": {"type": "string", "description": "查询日期，格式：YYYY-MM-DD"}
                    },
                    "required": ["city", "date"]
                }
            }
        }
    ],
    "tool_choice": "auto",
    "max_tokens": 500
}

### Probe Gemma4 Model - Streaming Test
# @name Streaming
POST http://192.168.1.14:10303/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "model": "gemma-4",
    "messages": [
        {"role": "user", "content": "Count from 1 to 5."}
    ],
    "stream": true,
    "max_tokens": 100
}
